WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:36.350
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:36.620 --> 01:38.970
[The Lament of Autumn]

3
01:39.380 --> 01:41.840
[Episode 28]

4
01:44.840 --> 01:46.009
For so many years,

5
01:49.009 --> 01:50.810
in this family,

6
01:53.400 --> 01:55.930
I've been enduring humiliation and burdens,

7
01:56.400 --> 01:58.130
treading on thin ice all along.

8
02:02.700 --> 02:04.220
I thought everything I did

9
02:04.250 --> 02:05.730
was worth it.

10
02:06.560 --> 02:09.280
I thought we'd eventually leave here

11
02:10.020 --> 02:11.710
and start a life of our own.

12
02:14.130 --> 02:14.750
But what did I

13
02:14.750 --> 02:16.610
get in return at the end of the day?

14
02:22.460 --> 02:23.930
Since it has come to this,

15
02:26.280 --> 02:27.610
I've had enough of being

16
02:29.000 --> 02:30.860
Yu Zhongquan's third concubine!

17
02:31.810 --> 02:32.870
-Wanqiao. -Let go of me!

18
02:32.870 --> 02:33.650
-Calm down! -Let go!

19
02:33.650 --> 02:34.900
-Let go of me! -Calm down!

20
02:34.900 --> 02:35.829
I'm telling you,

21
02:35.900 --> 02:37.250
I'll have everyone in this family

22
02:37.250 --> 02:38.110
know the truth!

23
03:11.780 --> 03:12.710
There has been no

24
03:14.300 --> 03:16.829
turning back since we stepped onto this path.

25
03:18.180 --> 03:19.020
I swear

26
03:20.520 --> 03:22.410
that I will never let anyone

27
03:26.310 --> 03:27.800
get in the way of our plan.

28
03:40.370 --> 03:42.180
Remember what you just said.

29
03:45.180 --> 03:46.180
Don't forget

30
03:48.240 --> 03:49.590
that you are never alone

31
03:51.860 --> 03:53.780
on the edge of a precipice.

32
04:52.740 --> 04:53.800
It's time to work!

33
04:54.130 --> 04:55.390
Don't you play dead!

34
04:59.600 --> 05:01.730
You want a good whipping again or what?

35
05:03.270 --> 05:04.120
Get a move on!

36
05:05.040 --> 05:06.330
Stop dawdling!

37
05:23.330 --> 05:24.530
Work hard, all of you!

38
05:25.300 --> 05:26.540
No work, no meal!

39
05:26.580 --> 05:27.090
Quick!

40
05:27.120 --> 05:27.850
Get a move on!

41
05:28.920 --> 05:29.320
Quick!

42
05:29.430 --> 05:30.630
Put some effort into it!

43
05:30.630 --> 05:31.760
Place it on the cart.

44
05:32.159 --> 05:33.040
You dawdlers!

45
05:33.750 --> 05:34.480
Geta move on!

46
05:35.600 --> 05:36.530
Drop the act!

47
05:36.630 --> 05:38.409
-Get up now. -Move it up. Quick!

48
05:38.500 --> 05:40.300
-Make it fast! -Quick!

49
05:40.330 --> 05:41.330
Hurry!

50
05:43.510 --> 05:44.370
Those up there,

51
05:44.630 --> 05:45.760
don't you slack off!

52
05:46.770 --> 05:47.500
Get a move on!

53
05:48.120 --> 05:48.850
Get digging!

54
05:51.300 --> 05:52.220
Keep going!

55
05:52.370 --> 05:53.770
Don't you dare slack off!

56
05:56.870 --> 05:57.870
-Hurry! -What are you looking at?

57
05:57.870 --> 05:59.400
How dare you glance around!

58
05:59.510 --> 06:01.440
Keep working! Don't you slack off!

59
06:04.250 --> 06:05.710
Don't any of you slack off!

60
06:06.750 --> 06:08.210
You want your meals or not?

61
06:13.770 --> 06:14.570
Hurry! Hurry!

62
06:15.750 --> 06:16.680
No slacking off!

63
06:17.330 --> 06:18.660
Put some effort into it!

64
06:20.100 --> 06:21.360
You hateful dawdlers.

65
06:21.690 --> 06:22.420
Get a move on!

66
06:24.950 --> 06:26.210
I'm talking about you!

67
06:26.830 --> 06:27.510
Quick!

68
06:28.680 --> 06:29.180
Quick!

69
06:31.560 --> 06:32.560
You guys up there!

70
06:34.720 --> 06:35.650
Hurry! Be quick!

71
06:36.070 --> 06:36.870
Keep digging!

72
06:39.180 --> 06:40.310
Don't you ever stop!

73
06:44.720 --> 06:45.570
Get digging!

74
06:46.360 --> 06:47.300
Faster!

75
06:50.240 --> 06:52.170
They are short-handed these days.

76
06:52.270 --> 06:53.270
The three o‘clock

77
06:53.540 --> 06:54.670
guard change at this watchtower

78
06:54.670 --> 06:56.190
has been delayed by 10 minutes.

79
06:56.190 --> 06:57.580
This is our last chance.

80
06:57.659 --> 06:58.159
Got it.

81
07:02.010 --> 07:03.920
Previously, he was beaten till his ribs broke,

82
07:03.920 --> 07:05.070
burned with a branding iron,

83
07:05.070 --> 07:06.620
and hung up for three days and nights,

84
07:06.620 --> 07:09.750
yet he still managed to incite others to escape with him.

85
07:14.190 --> 07:15.600
He's so tough.

86
07:16.810 --> 07:17.810
Isn't it exactly why

87
07:17.810 --> 07:20.670
you can't bring yourself to kill him, Commander Mu?

88
07:22.180 --> 07:23.660
I always cherish talent.

89
07:24.070 --> 07:24.890
When Jiang Xueting

90
07:24.890 --> 07:26.350
operated Xing Newspaper,

91
07:27.540 --> 07:28.920
an article of just one hundred words

92
07:28.920 --> 07:30.540
about the warlords' massacre

93
07:30.540 --> 07:33.470
caused the student unions in 10 provinces to strike.

94
07:33.770 --> 07:35.870
A mere article of his on military pay corruption

95
07:35.870 --> 07:38.870
directly led to a shake-up in the Ministry of Finance.

96
07:40.330 --> 07:41.980
What a perfect weapon he is.

97
07:45.040 --> 07:46.840
He's not only an amazing writer,

98
07:47.000 --> 07:49.060
but he also has great guts and vision.

99
07:51.000 --> 07:51.740
Let's go!

100
07:58.000 --> 07:58.980
A person like him

101
08:00.220 --> 08:02.420
may not be completely tamed right away.

102
08:04.720 --> 08:06.780
It won't hurt to spend some more time.

103
08:32.909 --> 08:33.429
Freeze!

104
08:41.460 --> 08:42.460
What was that for?

105
08:42.980 --> 08:45.180
No need to grieve for him, Commander Mu.

106
08:45.740 --> 08:46.700
He can still

107
08:47.790 --> 08:49.220
hold a pen with his hands.

108
08:51.600 --> 08:53.130
Only a lifelong disability

109
08:53.910 --> 08:56.010
can break his pride.

110
09:00.410 --> 09:02.150
Hatred seared into the flesh

111
09:04.630 --> 09:06.840
is the strongest driving force.

112
09:14.820 --> 09:18.170
[Yu Mansion]

113
09:25.150 --> 09:27.260
Fourth Lady, these are Mr. Bingwen's clothes.

114
09:27.260 --> 09:28.660
They've all been ironed.

115
09:28.890 --> 09:29.940
Put them away.

116
09:35.750 --> 09:36.350
Oh, right!

117
09:39.270 --> 09:41.100
These were found in the inner pocket of Mr. Bingwen's coat.

118
09:41.100 --> 09:42.560
He forgot to take them out.

119
09:47.890 --> 09:50.030
Actually, Mr. Bingwen cares a lot

120
09:50.050 --> 09:51.240
about you, Fourth Lady.

121
09:51.240 --> 09:53.130
It's all crystal clear to us.

122
09:53.700 --> 09:55.460
Mr. Bingwen specifically asked us

123
09:55.460 --> 09:57.200
to replace the blankets in the room

124
09:57.200 --> 09:58.780
and the cushions on the couch

125
09:58.780 --> 09:59.980
with thicker ones.

126
10:00.360 --> 10:01.160
And over here.

127
10:01.790 --> 10:03.930
The edges and corners that people could easily bump into

128
10:03.930 --> 10:06.660
have all been carefully wrapped with soft cloth.

129
10:07.940 --> 10:10.100
Mr. Bingwen has also reminded us many times

130
10:10.100 --> 10:11.670
to let him know anytime if you feel like

131
10:11.670 --> 10:12.410
eating

132
10:12.530 --> 10:13.870
or adding anything,

133
10:14.130 --> 10:16.730
since he wants to prepare everything himself.

134
10:21.220 --> 10:22.010
Qiujuan,

135
10:22.600 --> 10:23.600
I'm a bit tired.

136
10:24.150 --> 10:25.150
Help me to the bed.

137
10:25.700 --> 10:27.100
I'll lie down for a while.

138
10:52.740 --> 10:54.830
Fourth Lady, what's wrong?

139
10:55.010 --> 10:56.620
Are you feeling unwell?

140
10:56.720 --> 10:58.630
What exactly is going on, Fourth Lady?

141
10:58.630 --> 10:59.890
I fear so much for you.

142
11:01.700 --> 11:02.270
Blood!

143
11:02.740 --> 11:03.960
Why are you bleeding?

144
11:04.290 --> 11:05.420
Somebody come help!

145
11:05.500 --> 11:06.230
Fourth Lady!

146
11:06.290 --> 11:11.870
[Emergency Room]

147
11:12.600 --> 11:14.430
She's been in there for so long.

148
11:14.630 --> 11:16.700
Why isn't she out yet?

149
11:19.370 --> 11:19.930
Madam, don't fret.

150
11:19.930 --> 11:21.390
[Emergency Room] [Quiet]

151
11:21.390 --> 11:22.850
Sit down and rest for a bit.

152
11:22.980 --> 11:24.980
Fourth Lady is blessed by heaven.

153
11:25.170 --> 11:26.580
She will surely be fine.

154
11:27.250 --> 11:28.120
Yes, Mom.

155
11:28.220 --> 11:29.910
I've notified Father, Bingwen,

156
11:29.910 --> 11:30.900
and Changxuan.

157
11:30.980 --> 11:32.580
They are on their way back.

158
11:33.130 --> 11:34.310
Jinxuan has always been

159
11:34.310 --> 11:35.170
in good health.

160
11:35.360 --> 11:37.050
The baby will definitely be fine too.

161
11:37.050 --> 11:38.510
Just don't worry, Mother.

162
11:41.060 --> 11:42.680
[Emergency Room]

163
11:45.410 --> 11:46.290
Dr. Jiang.

164
11:46.580 --> 11:48.000
How is my daughter?

165
11:48.650 --> 11:49.730
Fourth Lady showed

166
11:49.750 --> 11:51.080
signs of a miscarriage.

167
11:51.390 --> 11:52.190
Fortunately,

168
11:52.200 --> 11:53.330
the baby is safe now.

169
11:53.740 --> 11:55.340
Fourth Lady is out of danger as well.

170
11:55.340 --> 11:56.390
So don't worry, everyone.

171
11:56.390 --> 11:57.320
Are you sure?

172
11:57.550 --> 11:58.970
We just gave Fourth Lady

173
11:59.000 --> 12:00.310
a full check-up.

174
12:00.340 --> 12:02.070
Please rest assured, Madam Yu.

175
12:02.870 --> 12:04.340
Thank goodness.

176
12:05.700 --> 12:06.340
That said,

177
12:06.840 --> 12:08.030
why were there

178
12:08.030 --> 12:09.830
signs of a miscarriage?

179
12:10.000 --> 12:12.200
Everyone's constitution is different.

180
12:12.200 --> 12:13.660
The examination suggests

181
12:13.770 --> 12:14.770
that Fourth Lady probably

182
12:14.770 --> 12:15.790
came into contact with

183
12:15.790 --> 12:17.920
drugs that might cause a miscarriage.

184
12:18.530 --> 12:19.630
That's odd.

185
12:21.130 --> 12:22.670
Ever since she got pregnant,

186
12:22.670 --> 12:24.590
she has been taken care of

187
12:24.610 --> 12:26.410
by our own people in the mansion.

188
12:26.440 --> 12:28.990
I've instructed them to be extra cautious

189
12:29.020 --> 12:30.680
with her daily food and drink.

190
12:30.890 --> 12:32.860
The exact cause cannot be determined

191
12:32.860 --> 12:34.700
through a mere check-up.

192
12:35.500 --> 12:37.360
If you need any help at home afterwards,

193
12:37.360 --> 12:38.170
just have Butler Zhou

194
12:38.170 --> 12:39.460
call me anytime.

195
12:41.670 --> 12:42.730
Thank you, doctor.

196
12:45.270 --> 12:46.080
Look into it.

197
12:46.790 --> 12:49.330
Have Zhou Tai investigate the matter right away.

198
12:49.330 --> 12:51.170
Look into all those who are responsible

199
12:51.170 --> 12:52.280
for attending to Fourth Lady,

200
12:52.280 --> 12:53.650
including maids and servants.

201
12:53.650 --> 12:53.980
[Emergency Room]

202
12:53.980 --> 12:55.130
Yes, Madam.

203
13:00.430 --> 13:00.740
[Yu Mansion]

204
13:00.740 --> 13:03.440
Commander Yu, Madam, I've conducted an investigation.

205
13:03.440 --> 13:05.170
There's nothing wrong with Fourth Lady's diet

206
13:05.170 --> 13:06.460
for the past few days,

207
13:06.460 --> 13:07.940
including soups and snacks.

208
13:07.940 --> 13:08.890
All those who are responsible

209
13:08.890 --> 13:10.460
for Fourth Lady's meals in the mansion

210
13:10.460 --> 13:11.770
have also been questioned.

211
13:11.770 --> 13:13.300
Nothing unusual was found.

212
13:13.940 --> 13:15.600
The food and drink is all fine.

213
13:16.600 --> 13:18.380
Then why did Jinxuan

214
13:18.410 --> 13:19.030
suddenly...

215
13:19.030 --> 13:20.360
Commander Yu, Madam Yu,

216
13:20.370 --> 13:22.200
judging from the medical report and the lab results

217
13:22.200 --> 13:23.660
provided by the hospital,

218
13:23.980 --> 13:24.980
Fourth Lady did

219
13:24.980 --> 13:26.510
come into contact with something

220
13:26.510 --> 13:28.310
that could cause a miscarriage.

221
13:28.840 --> 13:30.820
Since there's nothing wrong with her diet,

222
13:30.820 --> 13:32.200
I propose that you try to recall

223
13:32.200 --> 13:34.060
about her daily life as to whether

224
13:34.410 --> 13:35.910
she has come into contact with

225
13:35.910 --> 13:37.110
anything newly added

226
13:37.150 --> 13:38.310
or objects

227
13:39.100 --> 13:40.890
that she never touched before.

228
13:41.670 --> 13:42.440
Qiujuan,

229
13:42.960 --> 13:43.680
you are

230
13:43.710 --> 13:45.370
with Fourth Lady all the time.

231
13:46.000 --> 13:47.580
Think carefully.

232
13:49.670 --> 13:51.000
A few days ago,

233
13:51.120 --> 13:52.620
Fourth Lady started using a pillow

234
13:52.620 --> 13:53.650
filled with herbs,

235
13:53.650 --> 13:55.670
which is said to soothe the nerve and aid sleep.

236
13:55.670 --> 13:58.240
A pillow filled with herbs? Who gave it to her?

237
14:05.130 --> 14:07.530
What happened? Speak up.

238
14:09.590 --> 14:12.430
Father, Mother, that pillow was a gift

239
14:12.460 --> 14:13.980
from me to Jinxuan.

240
14:14.030 --> 14:16.030
It contains some nerve-soothing herbs.

241
14:16.030 --> 14:17.030
I had the recipe

242
14:17.030 --> 14:18.670
checked by a doctor already.

243
14:29.440 --> 14:30.480
I know about that.

244
14:30.840 --> 14:32.030
A couple of days ago, Pingjun

245
14:32.030 --> 14:33.630
did make a pillow with herbs.

246
14:33.870 --> 14:35.200
And I got her the fabric

247
14:35.500 --> 14:36.600
for the pillow.

248
14:37.390 --> 14:38.650
It's absolutely safe.

249
14:40.000 --> 14:41.260
Bring the pillow here.

250
14:41.550 --> 14:42.120
Yes.

251
14:42.770 --> 14:43.300
Let's go.

252
15:01.600 --> 15:03.430
Most of the herbs in it can indeed

253
15:03.460 --> 15:05.200
nourish the heart and settle the mind.

254
15:05.200 --> 15:06.170
However,

255
15:06.440 --> 15:07.820
they are mixed with a significant

256
15:07.820 --> 15:08.740
amount of musk.

257
15:11.010 --> 15:12.150
As for musk...

258
15:13.360 --> 15:14.320
If...

259
15:15.580 --> 15:17.700
If a pregnant woman is exposed to it for a long time,

260
15:17.700 --> 15:19.760
it may cause abnormal fatal movement

261
15:20.030 --> 15:21.760
and even lead to a miscarriage.

262
15:27.530 --> 15:30.270
You married into our family not long ago, yet you're

263
15:30.270 --> 15:32.330
already harboring wicked thoughts.

264
15:32.860 --> 15:33.520
Out with it!

265
15:34.050 --> 15:35.550
Why did you harm Jinxuan?

266
15:35.820 --> 15:36.630
Zhongquan,

267
15:36.870 --> 15:37.820
we haven't gotten

268
15:37.820 --> 15:39.100
to the bottom of this matter yet.

269
15:39.100 --> 15:40.670
Don't scare Pingjun.

270
15:40.740 --> 15:42.050
Let her take her time.

271
15:42.860 --> 15:43.520
Explain it.

272
15:46.700 --> 15:47.770
Father, Mother,

273
15:47.940 --> 15:49.480
I followed the recipe to gather

274
15:49.480 --> 15:50.720
the herbs for the pillow

275
15:50.720 --> 15:52.320
one by one from the pharmacy.

276
15:52.320 --> 15:54.220
They are all for soothing the nerve.

277
15:54.220 --> 15:56.220
There couldn't have been musk in it.

278
15:57.370 --> 15:58.440
It's indeed musk.

279
15:59.630 --> 16:02.090
There are witnesses and physical evidence.

280
16:02.120 --> 16:03.630
Are you still trying to deny it?

281
16:03.630 --> 16:06.570
From being bought in the pharmacy,

282
16:06.630 --> 16:08.090
washed, dried, cooled,

283
16:08.170 --> 16:09.700
to being made into a pillow,

284
16:09.840 --> 16:11.500
the herbs were handled by many people

285
16:11.500 --> 16:12.900
in these multiple steps.

286
16:12.940 --> 16:15.570
What makes you so sure that Pingjun did it?

287
16:16.130 --> 16:17.240
I trust Pingjun.

288
16:18.250 --> 16:19.980
She would never do such a thing.

289
16:20.050 --> 16:21.750
Changxuan has a point.

290
16:21.750 --> 16:23.670
The herbs were handled by many people.

291
16:23.670 --> 16:24.870
How can you say for sure

292
16:24.870 --> 16:26.480
that Pingjun harmed Jinxuan?

293
16:26.480 --> 16:27.650
Everything aside,

294
16:28.200 --> 16:30.390
there must be a motive behind every action.

295
16:30.390 --> 16:32.590
There's no grudge between Pingjun and Jinxuan.

296
16:32.590 --> 16:33.840
Why would she harm her?

297
16:33.840 --> 16:35.040
Because of jealousy.

298
16:35.630 --> 16:37.690
Should Jinxuan give birth to a child,

299
16:37.860 --> 16:40.390
it would the eldest grandson of the Yu family.

300
16:40.390 --> 16:42.700
You couldn't stand her having a child before you,

301
16:42.700 --> 16:44.990
so you came up with this evil plan.

302
16:45.200 --> 16:45.860
Right?

303
16:46.010 --> 16:46.860
Father,

304
16:47.240 --> 16:48.610
such random speculation

305
16:48.610 --> 16:49.860
is rather arbitrary.

306
16:50.860 --> 16:52.000
However, Changxuan,

307
16:52.000 --> 16:53.410
since the pillow

308
16:53.600 --> 16:55.060
was indeed given by Pingjun

309
16:55.060 --> 16:56.400
to Jinxuan,

310
16:56.820 --> 16:57.880
you must not be partial

311
16:57.880 --> 16:58.740
in this matter.

312
16:58.790 --> 17:00.590
You have to probe it thoroughly.

313
17:00.720 --> 17:01.790
When the one who tried

314
17:01.790 --> 17:03.600
to harm Jinxuan is figured out, I'll spare

315
17:03.600 --> 17:04.800
this person no mercy.

316
17:06.589 --> 17:08.560
Father, Mother,

317
17:08.790 --> 17:10.849
I know you are worried about Jinxuan.

318
17:10.859 --> 17:12.740
Ever since I learned about Jinxuan's pregnancy,

319
17:12.740 --> 17:14.349
I've been happier than anyone else.

320
17:14.349 --> 17:15.609
Never have I ever gotten jealous

321
17:15.609 --> 17:17.210
of her, not even a little bit.

322
17:17.250 --> 17:19.140
As long as the truth can be revealed,

323
17:19.140 --> 17:21.470
I will cooperate with any investigation.

324
17:31.000 --> 17:32.100
Mother, Father.

325
17:33.460 --> 17:35.390
Can I have word with you in private?

326
17:40.530 --> 17:41.010
Don't.

327
17:41.240 --> 17:41.990
Father,

328
17:42.510 --> 17:43.130
Mother,

329
17:44.140 --> 17:45.240
Pingjun and I...

330
17:49.900 --> 17:51.500
What are they talking about?

331
17:54.660 --> 17:55.460
Changxuan...

332
17:58.200 --> 17:58.930
Don't worry.

333
17:59.640 --> 18:01.640
I asked Father to give me three days.

334
18:01.940 --> 18:03.340
I will uncover the truth.

335
18:40.050 --> 18:40.850
Let go of me!

336
18:42.440 --> 18:43.620
You're hurting me!

337
18:54.680 --> 18:56.210
You're pointing a gun at me?

338
18:58.250 --> 18:59.850
It was your doing, wasn't it?

339
19:15.140 --> 19:16.700
Didn't I tell you

340
19:18.940 --> 19:20.870
not to make rash moves?

341
19:22.570 --> 19:23.380
What?

342
19:24.530 --> 19:25.530
Is your heart aching for her?

343
19:25.530 --> 19:27.270
She's carrying my child after all!

344
19:27.270 --> 19:28.350
Your child?

345
19:28.570 --> 19:30.570
That child belongs to the Yu family.

346
19:30.880 --> 19:31.880
Its surname is Yu.

347
19:34.720 --> 19:36.450
What does it have to do with you?

348
19:42.480 --> 19:44.210
We've come a long way together.

349
19:44.570 --> 19:46.100
We once slept under bridges

350
19:46.350 --> 19:47.440
and ate rats.

351
19:48.220 --> 19:49.490
We were chased and beaten

352
19:49.490 --> 19:51.420
on the streets till we almost died!

353
19:51.610 --> 19:52.670
All that suffering

354
19:53.380 --> 19:55.200
was caused by the Yu family.

355
20:00.200 --> 20:01.850
Stop eating it. Spit it out!

356
20:01.900 --> 20:03.300
-Spit it out! -Wanqiao.

357
20:03.320 --> 20:05.030
-Stop it! -You can't eat that thing!

358
20:05.030 --> 20:05.810
Be good.

359
20:10.110 --> 20:10.790
Bingwen.

360
20:11.790 --> 20:13.610
We only have each other now.

361
20:17.140 --> 20:19.270
The person who reduced us to this state

362
20:19.400 --> 20:20.700
is named Yu Zhongquan.

363
20:22.090 --> 20:23.090
Keep this in mind—

364
20:23.830 --> 20:25.410
you must live on.

365
20:27.110 --> 20:28.700
We must get our revenge!

366
20:30.070 --> 20:30.750
Bingwen,

367
20:31.590 --> 20:33.190
from now on, whatever you do,

368
20:33.830 --> 20:35.070
I'll help you with it.

369
20:35.550 --> 20:37.620
Wherever you go, I'll go with you.

370
20:37.830 --> 20:39.160
We will never be apart.

371
20:42.770 --> 20:43.770
Didn't you swear

372
20:44.530 --> 20:45.880
to put the Yu family

373
20:46.500 --> 20:48.140
to a terrible death?

374
20:50.010 --> 20:50.830
Given that,

375
20:52.570 --> 20:53.790
wasn't it a real delight

376
20:53.790 --> 20:54.920
to start our revenge

377
20:55.830 --> 20:58.030
with the Yu family's first grandchild?

378
21:00.680 --> 21:02.120
You should be pleased.

379
21:03.570 --> 21:04.810
Why don't you smile?

380
21:19.090 --> 21:20.450
Don't you think I have no idea

381
21:20.450 --> 21:21.580
what's on your mind.

382
21:23.440 --> 21:24.300
I'm determined

383
21:24.330 --> 21:25.660
to crush all your hopes.

384
21:26.880 --> 21:27.850
It was you

385
21:29.460 --> 21:31.460
who dragged me into this vengeance.

386
21:33.920 --> 21:35.920
I've staked everything I have on it,

387
21:37.790 --> 21:38.660
including you.

388
23:07.070 --> 23:11.100
[Tongrenhe Pharmacy]

389
23:11.750 --> 23:14.000
Do you keep a record of the herbs bought and sold

390
23:14.000 --> 23:15.130
in the past few days?

391
23:15.480 --> 23:16.270
Yes, we do.

392
23:18.930 --> 23:18.990
[Records of Incoming and Outgoing Goods]

393
23:18.990 --> 23:19.810
We keep detailed records

394
23:19.810 --> 23:21.300
of the daily incoming and outgoing

395
23:21.300 --> 23:22.500
quantities of goods.

396
23:23.550 --> 23:24.880
This entry here records

397
23:25.030 --> 23:26.530
the same amount of herbs as that

398
23:26.530 --> 23:28.130
in the Young Madam's recipe.

399
23:34.140 --> 23:36.940
Could it be possible that you gave her a wrong herb?

400
23:44.790 --> 23:46.720
Butler Zhou, why did Fifth Young Master

401
23:46.720 --> 23:48.750
ask to see me in the middle of the night?

402
23:48.750 --> 23:50.000
I don't know the specifics.

403
23:50.000 --> 23:50.960
No more dawdling.

404
23:50.960 --> 23:52.160
Hurry to the meeting.

405
24:07.180 --> 24:09.790
Ye Pingjun, It is all your fault.

406
24:11.220 --> 24:12.150
This isn't over.

407
24:21.200 --> 24:21.880
Qiuluo,

408
24:22.770 --> 24:24.170
aren't you supposed to be serving

409
24:24.170 --> 24:25.140
Fifth Young Madam?

410
24:25.140 --> 24:27.270
What are you doing here in the kitchen?

411
24:35.240 --> 24:37.550
We couldn't have distributed a wrong herb.

412
24:37.550 --> 24:39.140
Frequent contact with musk

413
24:39.170 --> 24:40.700
could cause a rash on the hands.

414
24:40.700 --> 24:42.560
We are all very careful around it.

415
24:50.880 --> 24:52.680
Fifth Young Master, she's here.

416
24:55.870 --> 24:56.550
Fifth Young Master,

417
24:56.550 --> 24:58.550
may I ask what this meeting is about?

418
24:58.640 --> 24:59.650
Nothing serious.

419
25:00.440 --> 25:01.800
I just wanted to ask you

420
25:02.010 --> 25:04.210
if you've noticed anyone in the mansion

421
25:04.240 --> 25:06.440
with a red rash on their hands recently.

422
25:07.850 --> 25:08.550
No, no one.

423
25:10.310 --> 25:11.640
Think again carefully.

424
25:12.660 --> 25:14.010
When we wash clothes,

425
25:14.010 --> 25:16.010
seven or eight maids, young and old,

426
25:16.050 --> 25:17.850
would gather around a big basin.

427
25:18.050 --> 25:18.880
Some scrub the clothes,

428
25:18.880 --> 25:19.720
and some rinse them.

429
25:19.720 --> 25:21.200
Everyone can see

430
25:21.400 --> 25:23.330
the others' hands.

431
25:23.610 --> 25:25.010
Anyone with a conspicuous

432
25:25.010 --> 25:26.570
red rash on their hands

433
25:26.830 --> 25:28.460
would definitely be noticed.

434
25:28.460 --> 25:29.810
These days,

435
25:30.090 --> 25:31.530
I haven't seen anything unusual

436
25:31.530 --> 25:32.900
with anyone's hands.

437
25:35.380 --> 25:36.190
I see.

438
25:36.790 --> 25:37.900
Leave and take a rest.

439
25:37.900 --> 25:39.300
Yes, Fifth Young Master.

440
25:42.590 --> 25:44.320
Oh, right, Fifth Young Master.

441
25:45.050 --> 25:46.200
I just recalled it.

442
25:46.510 --> 25:48.340
It got warmer a few days ago,

443
25:48.610 --> 25:49.550
but a maid

444
25:49.690 --> 25:50.600
still had a worn

445
25:50.630 --> 25:52.310
long-sleeved jacket on all the time,

446
25:52.310 --> 25:53.440
with her wrists

447
25:53.460 --> 25:54.770
covered tightly.

448
25:54.980 --> 25:56.840
Inside the sleeves, there seemed

449
25:56.900 --> 25:58.460
to be a layer of thin gauze.

450
25:58.940 --> 26:00.030
At that time, I thought

451
26:00.030 --> 26:01.770
this young maid just wanted to look pretty,

452
26:01.770 --> 26:02.810
so she imitated the foreign-educated

453
26:02.810 --> 26:04.250
students and tried out new styles.

454
26:04.250 --> 26:05.640
Now that I think of it,

455
26:06.290 --> 26:08.000
it was indeed a bit strange.

456
26:09.770 --> 26:11.110
Who is this maid?

457
26:11.740 --> 26:13.050
Don't miss a single corner.

458
26:13.050 --> 26:14.850
Make sure you search carefully!

459
26:20.720 --> 26:21.380
Smell this.

460
26:22.920 --> 26:24.330
It's an anti-itch ointment.

461
26:24.330 --> 26:26.330
Where is Qiuluo? Why isn't she here?

462
26:26.420 --> 26:28.310
Qiuluo said she had something to do

463
26:28.310 --> 26:30.100
and went out half an hour ago.

464
27:08.730 --> 27:11.340
Qiuluo surely got a lot of nerve.

465
27:11.660 --> 27:12.360
I can't believe

466
27:12.360 --> 27:14.090
she'd do something so heinous.

467
27:14.790 --> 27:16.130
She even sneaked out

468
27:16.160 --> 27:17.220
and tried to flee.

469
27:17.750 --> 27:19.080
Getting run over by a car

470
27:19.330 --> 27:20.590
was what she deserved.

471
27:20.680 --> 27:22.420
Can you stop talking about it?

472
27:22.670 --> 27:24.810
Jinxuan is in recovery.

473
27:30.050 --> 27:30.850
Pingjun.

474
27:32.070 --> 27:34.330
Your father-in-law almost wronged you.

475
27:34.830 --> 27:36.700
Please don't take it to heart.

476
27:39.010 --> 27:40.270
Little did I expect you

477
27:40.570 --> 27:42.570
to be put through so much suffering.

478
27:43.000 --> 27:44.560
Jinxuan, Mother,

479
27:44.790 --> 27:46.770
I'm just glad that the truth is out now.

480
27:46.770 --> 27:48.330
I didn't suffer at all.

481
27:49.050 --> 27:50.190
Don't you worry.

482
27:52.010 --> 27:52.740
From now on,

483
27:53.550 --> 27:54.660
both newcomers

484
27:54.690 --> 27:56.750
and existing servants in the mansion

485
27:56.770 --> 27:59.510
must be strictly disciplined by Zhou Tai.

486
27:59.960 --> 28:01.310
We absolutely cannot let those

487
28:01.310 --> 28:03.980
with malicious intentions enter the Yu residence

488
28:03.980 --> 28:06.240
and cause huge trouble like this again.

489
28:11.500 --> 28:12.500
Have a bit more.

490
28:18.160 --> 28:18.750
Father.

491
28:20.840 --> 28:22.370
Now that Qiuluo's incident

492
28:22.500 --> 28:24.360
has proven Pingjun's innocence,

493
28:24.640 --> 28:26.520
shouldn't you make a gesture?

494
28:27.600 --> 28:28.660
What gesture?

495
28:29.090 --> 28:30.350
Just apologize to her.

496
28:30.460 --> 28:32.190
You're asking me to apologize?

497
28:32.330 --> 28:33.350
Get this straight.

498
28:33.350 --> 28:34.350
I'm senior to her,

499
28:34.360 --> 28:35.220
and she's junior to me.

500
28:35.220 --> 28:36.680
How can I apologize to her?

501
28:38.270 --> 28:40.330
Ever since you got together with her,

502
28:41.110 --> 28:44.030
you've lost all sense of seniority.

503
28:46.880 --> 28:48.070
You are senior to her.

504
28:48.070 --> 28:49.620
If you don't want to apologize,

505
28:49.620 --> 28:50.620
I won't force you.

506
28:51.850 --> 28:52.830
But I hope

507
28:53.400 --> 28:55.620
you can be less hostile to Pingjun,

508
28:56.270 --> 28:58.270
and show her more respect and trust.

509
29:00.070 --> 29:02.260
You're challenging the proper order of things.

510
29:02.260 --> 29:03.110
You know?

511
29:04.540 --> 29:06.280
For the sake of your wife,

512
29:06.440 --> 29:08.300
you are actually lecturing

513
29:08.330 --> 29:09.290
your own father.

514
29:09.880 --> 29:11.390
If Pingjun continues to be

515
29:11.410 --> 29:13.070
subjected to such hostility,

516
29:14.630 --> 29:16.900
I'll have no choice but to move out with her.

517
29:16.900 --> 29:18.030
Suit yourself then.

518
29:24.660 --> 29:27.520
The kitchen specially prepared some ginseng soup.

519
29:29.510 --> 29:30.720
Come on, have a sip.

520
29:36.810 --> 29:40.880
What a blessed child.

521
29:54.920 --> 29:55.660
Mother,

522
29:57.010 --> 29:58.350
actually, at first,

523
29:59.010 --> 30:00.800
I never once considered

524
30:00.830 --> 30:02.510
how to be a mother.

525
30:04.070 --> 30:05.740
Neither did I think this child

526
30:05.940 --> 30:07.380
came at the right time.

527
30:09.140 --> 30:10.480
But that day,

528
30:11.180 --> 30:13.460
when I heard the doctor say

529
30:15.540 --> 30:17.360
that I might lose the baby,

530
30:22.640 --> 30:24.340
my heart ached so much

531
30:25.720 --> 30:27.320
that I could barely breathe.

532
30:30.920 --> 30:33.050
Only at that time did I finally realize

533
30:34.070 --> 30:35.090
how terrified I am

534
30:35.120 --> 30:37.440
of losing this child.

535
30:43.610 --> 30:45.940
That's the bond between mother and child.

536
30:47.900 --> 30:50.810
It's in a mother's nature to care for

537
30:51.110 --> 30:52.770
her children.

538
30:53.740 --> 30:56.140
As the child grows day by day,

539
30:57.160 --> 30:59.820
you'll gain a deeper and deeper understanding.

540
31:02.350 --> 31:03.700
You're right, Mother.

541
31:05.070 --> 31:06.730
This is my own flesh and blood.

542
31:11.700 --> 31:13.150
I promise to try my best

543
31:13.180 --> 31:14.740
to take care of this baby,

544
31:15.680 --> 31:17.530
and ensure it is safely born

545
31:18.480 --> 31:21.140
and grows up healthy.

546
31:25.010 --> 31:26.960
Now you've grown up.

547
31:39.440 --> 31:41.270
I made you some almond tea.

548
31:41.720 --> 31:42.790
Drinking it before bed

549
31:42.790 --> 31:44.320
will help you sleep better.

550
31:51.570 --> 31:53.770
Thank you. I'll drink it in a bit.

551
32:01.700 --> 32:03.360
Anything you want to say to me?

552
32:12.880 --> 32:14.450
Regarding this matter...

553
32:16.180 --> 32:17.200
Thank you.

554
32:28.450 --> 32:29.860
Do you wonder what I said

555
32:30.660 --> 32:31.840
to my parents

556
32:31.880 --> 32:33.530
behind the screen that day?

557
32:34.640 --> 32:35.750
What did you say?

558
32:39.830 --> 32:40.610
I said,

559
32:42.030 --> 32:44.230
"Pingjun hasn't fully accepted me yet.

560
32:46.140 --> 32:47.520
She's just

561
32:48.140 --> 32:49.410
an innocent maiden.

562
32:51.010 --> 32:53.070
Why would she be jealous of Jinxuan?"

563
32:54.240 --> 32:54.900
Father,

564
32:55.650 --> 32:56.270
Mother,

565
32:59.000 --> 33:00.320
Pingjun and I haven't

566
33:01.470 --> 33:03.200
consummated our marriage yet.

567
33:04.250 --> 33:07.110
How are you so silly?

568
33:08.900 --> 33:09.610
But you

569
33:09.640 --> 33:11.540
insisted on marrying her.

570
33:11.960 --> 33:12.860
For what?

571
33:13.700 --> 33:14.420
Pingjun hasn't

572
33:14.420 --> 33:16.150
fully recovered her memories.

573
33:16.500 --> 33:19.160
She said that she can't treat me as her husband

574
33:19.790 --> 33:21.210
before she could really feel a bond

575
33:21.210 --> 33:21.890
between us.

576
33:22.700 --> 33:24.230
And I respect her decision.

577
33:25.080 --> 33:25.820
Therefore,

578
33:26.290 --> 33:27.480
we're now building a bond

579
33:27.480 --> 33:28.480
little by little.

580
33:29.830 --> 33:32.880
A-Are you sure everything's all right with you?

581
33:33.610 --> 33:34.290
Father.

582
33:36.270 --> 33:37.760
Just give me three days.

583
33:38.380 --> 33:39.780
I will find out the truth.

584
33:48.330 --> 33:50.690
Today, Mother asked me about my plans,

585
33:52.800 --> 33:55.060
saying that she's waiting for an answer.

586
33:57.070 --> 33:58.000
When do you think

587
33:59.500 --> 34:00.310
would be a good time

588
34:00.310 --> 34:01.970
for me to give her that answer?

589
35:32.400 --> 35:33.200
Ye Pingjun.

590
35:35.470 --> 35:36.510
Up till now,

591
35:38.260 --> 35:39.200
do I still not

592
35:39.200 --> 35:40.660
have a place in your heart?

593
35:45.130 --> 35:46.480
I-I...

594
36:01.060 --> 36:02.110
Yu Changxuan.

595
36:04.530 --> 36:05.390
Don't worry.

596
36:07.220 --> 36:08.950
I won't force you into anything

597
36:09.740 --> 36:11.050
non-concensual.

598
36:12.380 --> 36:13.170
I will wait

599
36:14.690 --> 36:16.510
till the day you truly accept me.

600
36:28.550 --> 36:29.490
Pingjun...

601
36:30.670 --> 36:31.470
Pingjun...

602
36:34.000 --> 36:35.230
Have you heard?

603
36:35.260 --> 36:36.940
Deputy Commander Yu is marrying

604
36:36.940 --> 36:38.540
a daughter of the Tao family.

605
36:39.120 --> 36:41.140
Is it still Second Young Lady Tao?

606
36:41.170 --> 36:42.050
No.

607
36:42.230 --> 36:43.630
But it's pretty much the same.

608
36:43.630 --> 36:44.960
That girl is said to be

609
36:44.980 --> 36:46.580
President Tao's love child.

610
37:54.170 --> 37:54.800
Wanqiao,

611
37:55.840 --> 37:56.700
we need to talk.

612
37:57.600 --> 37:58.580
What's there

613
37:59.400 --> 38:00.820
to talk about between us?

614
38:02.460 --> 38:04.620
I shouldn't have acted on impulse that day.

615
38:04.620 --> 38:05.680
I apologize to you.

616
38:07.640 --> 38:08.820
You did say it right.

617
38:09.640 --> 38:11.440
I really lost control of myself.

618
38:12.590 --> 38:15.120
After all, I've been married to her for years.

619
38:16.740 --> 38:17.800
I'm sorry that I let

620
38:18.510 --> 38:20.310
my feelings got the better of me.

621
38:20.770 --> 38:22.500
But you and I are both well aware

622
38:22.680 --> 38:23.780
that there's absolutely

623
38:23.780 --> 38:25.510
no chance for me and Yu Jinxuan.

624
38:26.400 --> 38:27.330
One day, she and I

625
38:28.360 --> 38:30.220
will be irreconcilably opposed.

626
38:33.200 --> 38:34.010
It's just...

627
38:36.110 --> 38:38.110
It's just that our baby is innocent.

628
38:39.530 --> 38:40.530
Now that you know

629
38:40.530 --> 38:41.420
the baby is innocent,

630
38:41.420 --> 38:44.020
you have more reason to stop it from being born.

631
38:44.670 --> 38:45.630
Don't you forget

632
38:47.110 --> 38:48.240
that I have Wanxuan.

633
38:50.290 --> 38:53.090
I know better than you do about how much that hurts.

634
38:56.900 --> 38:58.300
Wanxuan's birth

635
39:00.610 --> 39:02.210
was a mistake from the start.

636
39:04.080 --> 39:05.040
Sometimes,

637
39:06.230 --> 39:07.750
I wish I could love her

638
39:07.770 --> 39:09.300
like any other mother does.

639
39:11.430 --> 39:12.760
But I just can't.

640
39:14.200 --> 39:15.100
Do you get it?

641
39:16.700 --> 39:18.320
Do you know how it feels to have

642
39:18.320 --> 39:19.810
a dull blade cut your flesh?

643
39:19.810 --> 39:20.610
Wanqiao.

644
39:24.080 --> 39:26.880
I'm sorry for all you've been through these years.

645
39:35.440 --> 39:37.770
Actually, there's no need for apologies.

646
39:39.970 --> 39:41.900
Now that things have come this far,

647
39:44.030 --> 39:46.630
I have no choice but to keep going down the path.

648
39:48.610 --> 39:49.400
Bingwen,

649
39:51.920 --> 39:52.920
rest assured.

650
39:56.310 --> 39:57.810
I will always be with you.

651
40:21.920 --> 40:24.650
If you can't bring yourself to do certain things,

652
40:26.220 --> 40:27.870
let me do them for you then.

653
40:45.530 --> 40:47.450
[Yu Mansion]

654
40:55.680 --> 40:56.340
A toast.

655
40:57.210 --> 40:58.560
Welcome, Daiti.

656
40:58.580 --> 40:59.450
Thank you.

657
41:07.620 --> 41:08.970
Dig in, everyone.

658
41:10.700 --> 41:11.510
Miss Jun,

659
41:12.650 --> 41:13.700
how has your father been

660
41:13.700 --> 41:15.730
in the U.S. over these years?

661
41:15.770 --> 41:17.340
He rarely comes back.

662
41:17.890 --> 41:19.790
Uncle, my father has been teaching

663
41:19.790 --> 41:21.130
at Columbia Law School.

664
41:21.280 --> 41:21.880
Last year,

665
41:21.900 --> 41:23.300
the U.S. military invited him to serve

666
41:23.300 --> 41:24.200
as their political advisor

667
41:24.200 --> 41:25.070
for East Asia.

668
41:25.670 --> 41:27.570
Her father is a great talent.

669
41:28.970 --> 41:30.360
Changxuan told me

670
41:30.390 --> 41:31.700
that you came back this time

671
41:31.700 --> 41:33.550
to establish a girls' school in Nanhuai,

672
41:33.550 --> 41:34.720
right?

673
41:35.430 --> 41:36.570
-Really? -Really.

674
41:37.850 --> 41:38.510
Auntie,

675
41:38.540 --> 41:40.420
Chinese women are said to believe in fate,

676
41:40.420 --> 41:41.320
but I think

677
41:41.320 --> 41:42.430
one can change one's fate

678
41:42.430 --> 41:44.230
through knowledge and culture.

679
41:45.520 --> 41:46.310
Daiti,

680
41:46.340 --> 41:47.300
well said.

681
41:47.320 --> 41:49.160
You are amazing.

682
41:49.320 --> 41:50.610
W-Would you

683
41:50.630 --> 41:52.590
join my Mulan Club

684
41:52.620 --> 41:53.740
and be our advisor?

685
41:53.770 --> 41:54.170
Sure.

686
41:54.410 --> 41:55.180
Thank you!

687
41:55.210 --> 41:56.320
Not everyone is like you,

688
41:56.320 --> 41:57.670
always rushing around mindlessly

689
41:57.670 --> 41:58.150
without knowing

690
41:58.150 --> 41:59.050
what you're doing.

691
41:59.050 --> 42:00.520
Don't you hold Daiti back from real business.

692
42:00.520 --> 42:03.050
You're the one who's not doing real business.

693
42:03.420 --> 42:04.110
Changxuan,

694
42:04.400 --> 42:05.150
I haven't had a chance

695
42:05.150 --> 42:06.770
to congratulate you and your wife yet.

696
42:06.770 --> 42:07.980
I always wondered

697
42:07.980 --> 42:08.620
what kind of woman

698
42:08.620 --> 42:09.830
you would marry.

699
42:10.270 --> 42:11.940
Today, I finally see your other half.

700
42:11.940 --> 42:13.800
You two are such a perfect couple.

701
42:14.100 --> 42:15.810
Of course. I always have

702
42:15.920 --> 42:16.830
the best taste.

703
42:16.930 --> 42:18.830
Then I wish you two a happy marriage

704
42:18.830 --> 42:20.290
and a lifetime of harmony.

705
42:21.370 --> 42:22.350
I also wish you, Miss Jun,

706
42:22.350 --> 42:24.110
all the best in your future work.

707
42:24.110 --> 42:24.840
Thank you.

708
42:31.930 --> 42:32.860
Do you remember?

709
42:33.010 --> 42:34.290
This is your childhood favorite—

710
42:34.290 --> 42:35.440
pearl meatballs.

711
42:36.010 --> 42:37.410
You still remember that?

712
42:37.520 --> 42:38.380
I certainly do.

713
42:38.870 --> 42:40.170
At the age of five,

714
42:40.170 --> 42:42.230
you ate a big bowl of these in one go.

715
42:42.270 --> 42:43.690
Then you ended up having a severe stomache

716
42:43.690 --> 42:45.560
and asked for a doctor desperately.

717
42:45.560 --> 42:46.920
Who could've forgotten that?

718
42:46.920 --> 42:48.900
Can't you remember something good about me?

719
42:48.900 --> 42:50.100
You're one to talk—

720
42:50.310 --> 42:51.140
I remember you being

721
42:51.140 --> 42:52.560
quite chubby when you were little.

722
42:52.560 --> 42:53.960
Your father threw you into the water,

723
42:53.960 --> 42:55.170
and you just sank like a stone—

724
42:55.170 --> 42:56.340
glug, glug, glug.

725
42:56.360 --> 42:58.290
God knows how much water you drunk.

726
42:58.690 --> 43:00.420
Father, did that truly happen?

727
43:00.560 --> 43:01.520
Yes, it did.

728
43:03.370 --> 43:04.780
As it turns out, Yu Changxuan

729
43:04.780 --> 43:06.710
was a chubby boy when he was little.

730
43:11.770 --> 43:12.640
You're leaving

731
43:12.640 --> 43:13.970
after a one-month stay?

732
43:14.150 --> 43:15.410
Anything urgent to do?

733
43:17.060 --> 43:19.230
Mother, this time, Daiti came back

734
43:19.330 --> 43:20.800
just to scout things out

735
43:20.830 --> 43:22.080
and make preparations.

736
43:22.080 --> 43:23.150
Yes, Auntie.

737
43:23.260 --> 43:24.560
I have some things to wrap up

738
43:24.560 --> 43:25.820
in the U.S.

739
43:25.840 --> 43:26.490
Once they're done,

740
43:26.490 --> 43:27.950
I'll be back here for good.

741
43:28.770 --> 43:29.430
Have a seat.

742
43:36.460 --> 43:38.610
Bring some tea and snacks over.

743
43:39.400 --> 43:39.920
Mother,

744
43:39.920 --> 43:40.810
let me do it.

745
43:41.010 --> 43:42.670
No need. Leave it to the maids.

746
43:43.150 --> 43:44.080
It's no trouble.

747
43:48.480 --> 43:49.270
Be seated.

748
43:51.710 --> 43:52.600
What a pity.

749
43:53.060 --> 43:54.710
Miss Jun is one step too late.

750
43:54.980 --> 43:56.100
By the time she returned,

751
43:56.100 --> 43:56.970
Fifth Young Master

752
43:56.970 --> 43:58.570
had already gotten married.

753
43:58.680 --> 43:59.500
Ms. Zhao,

754
43:59.520 --> 44:00.540
what do you mean?

755
44:00.870 --> 44:03.540
You joined the household late, so you don't know.

756
44:03.540 --> 44:05.290
Years ago, Commander Yu and Madam Yu

757
44:05.290 --> 44:07.270
meant to arrange a marriage between Miss Jun

758
44:07.270 --> 44:09.600
and Fifth Young Master when they were little.

759
44:09.600 --> 44:11.600
From family background to looks,

760
44:11.750 --> 44:12.600
aren't they

761
44:12.600 --> 44:14.200
a perfect match in every way?

762
44:15.140 --> 44:16.900
But Miss Jun followed her father

763
44:16.900 --> 44:17.940
to America.

764
44:18.490 --> 44:20.030
If she had come back a bit earlier,

765
44:20.030 --> 44:21.420
the position of Fifth Young Madam

766
44:21.420 --> 44:22.770
would probably have been hers.

767
44:22.770 --> 44:24.500
They do look like a great match.

768
44:24.500 --> 44:26.500
Miss Jun seems good-natured,

769
44:26.570 --> 44:27.920
bubbly and outgoing.

770
44:27.940 --> 44:30.580
You are so short-sighted.

771
44:31.040 --> 44:31.940
Do Commander Yu and Madam Yu

772
44:31.940 --> 44:33.800
like her for having a nice temper?

773
44:34.250 --> 44:36.560
The Jun family has established a presence

774
44:36.560 --> 44:39.290
in America and gained a foothold in the military.

775
44:39.910 --> 44:41.390
Even the government here

776
44:41.410 --> 44:42.650
has to go through her father

777
44:42.650 --> 44:44.120
to talk to their American counterparts.

778
44:44.120 --> 44:45.220
They're that influential?

779
44:45.220 --> 44:47.480
Under the current chaotic circumstances,

780
44:47.480 --> 44:49.280
not to mention ordinary people,

781
44:49.540 --> 44:51.650
even those in high positions with power

782
44:51.650 --> 44:53.770
can't be compared to the Jun family.

783
45:04.870 --> 45:05.800
Are you alright?

784
45:07.330 --> 45:08.390
Did you get burned?

785
45:12.960 --> 45:13.770
I'm fine.

786
45:17.940 --> 45:18.740
What's wrong?

787
45:19.270 --> 45:20.000
You seemed

788
45:21.000 --> 45:22.530
distracted all afternoon.

789
45:24.260 --> 45:25.730
I was just...

790
45:26.380 --> 45:28.430
thinking about something.

791
45:34.270 --> 45:35.330
Are you...

792
45:36.670 --> 45:37.640
jealous?

793
45:43.640 --> 45:44.440
I'm not.

794
45:47.730 --> 45:48.850
I knew I smelled something

795
45:48.850 --> 45:50.170
when I first walked in.

796
45:51.370 --> 45:53.550
As it turns out, you're being jealous.

797
45:57.500 --> 45:58.360
Why tease me

798
45:58.390 --> 45:59.810
the moment you came back?

799
46:02.100 --> 46:03.670
Let go of me.

800
46:07.150 --> 46:08.790
You're so childish.

801
46:09.730 --> 46:11.190
You got mad simply because

802
46:11.650 --> 46:12.650
I saw you through.

803
46:17.980 --> 46:19.640
Hey, did you hear me?

804
46:21.420 --> 46:22.210
Who is "Hey"?

805
46:34.230 --> 46:35.020
Alright.

806
46:39.230 --> 46:41.140
I know my position well.

807
46:41.980 --> 46:43.640
If you were truly jealous,

808
46:43.980 --> 46:45.380
I would be overjoyed.

809
46:52.640 --> 46:53.850
Pingjun, listen.

810
46:55.900 --> 46:57.960
Daiti really is just a friend of mine.

811
46:58.870 --> 47:00.140
I have never laid eyes

812
47:01.250 --> 47:02.690
on any other woman.

813
47:05.400 --> 47:07.900
I'm only looking forward to being

814
47:07.900 --> 47:09.810
granted a proper title

815
47:10.000 --> 47:11.580
by you, Fifth Young Madam.

816
47:18.370 --> 47:20.500
You promised to give me time.

817
47:22.370 --> 47:23.100
I did.

818
47:24.260 --> 47:25.460
And I'll keep my word.

819
47:43.940 --> 47:45.810
You're so lucky, lad.

820
47:46.170 --> 47:48.040
A big shot has paid to get you out.
